<title>GERMANY: German inland gas oil steady amid firm demand.</title>
<headline>German inland gas oil steady amid firm demand.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DLR/DM=1.5365)   DM/100 LTRS     DLRS/100 LTRS   LAST DM</p>
<p> HAMBURG	     37.70/37.90     24.53/24.66     37.80/38.10</p>
<p> BREMEN		37.70/37.90     24.53/24.66     37.80/38.10</p>
<p> DUISBURG	    37.90/38.20     24.66/24.86     38.10/38.40</p>
<p> FRANKFURT	   38.50/38.80     25.05/25.25     38.70/39.00</p>
<p> KARLSRUHE	   38.60/38.90     25.12/25.31     38.80/39.10</p>
<p> INGOLSTADT	  39.60/39.90     25.77/25.96     39.70/40.10</p>
<p>German inland gas oil prices were mainly steady on Friday with suppliers reporting firm demand supported by colder weather over most of the country, including snowfall. -- London newsroom +44 171 542 7646</p>
</text>
